    "description": "Drishti Eye Care Holdings Services has an exciting opening for a Radiologist at our Bhubaneswar office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Drishti Eye Care Holdings Services:\nDrishti Eye Care Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Ensure patient privacy and maintain confidentiality\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Pharmacovigilance\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Health Informatics\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Learning & development budget\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bhubaneswar, Odisha, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Drishti Eye Care Holdings Services!",
